# ===== Secrets / config with connection strings or signing keys =====
# appsettings.json holds a real (dev) connection string + JWT Key + Secret -> never commit.
appsettings.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
appsettings.local.json
secrets.json
# NOTE: appsettings.Production.json is intentionally KEPT — it is placeholders-only (__SET_ON_SERVER__), the safe template.

